  Sources/App/AppRoute.swift            (MOD: +.gasPrice case / pathSegment "gas-price" / "fuelpump.fill" icon / System group)
  Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift            (MOD: refactor the 17-deep routeHosts chain into a flat `routeHostRegistry` builder
                                         + register GasPriceAutoPollRouteRegistration)
  Localization/Localizable.xcstrings    (MOD: +route.gasPrice = "Gas Prices")
  apps/parity/apple-ledger.json         (MOD: +2 rows page:admin/GasPriceAutoPoll 2/2, apple-macos + apple-ios)

Pre-existing blockers corrected to reach a green full-app build + test bundle (these are
